    "Privacy": {
        "title": "Privacy Policy",
        "intro": "autopass (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting it through our compliance with this Privacy Policy. This document explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use the autopass mobile application (the \"App\").",
        "readCarefully": "Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. If you do not agree with the terms of this Privacy Policy, please do not access the App.",
        "collectTitle": "1. Information We Collect",
        "collectLead": "We may collect information about you in a variety of ways when you use our App. The information we may collect includes:",
        "personalTitle": "A. Personal Data",
        "personalLead": "When you register for an account, book a car wash, or interact with our services, we may collect identifiable information, such as:",
        "personalName": "Name and Surname",
        "personalPhone": "Phone number (used for registration and OTP verification)",
        "personalEmail": "Email address (optional or for support purposes)",
        "vehicleTitle": "B. Vehicle Data",
        "vehicleLead": "To provide our subscription and booking services, we collect information about the vehicles you add to your profile, including:",
        "vehicleMake": "Vehicle make and model",
        "vehiclePlate": "License plate number",
        "locationTitle": "C. Location Data",
        "locationBody": "With your explicit permission, we may collect and use your precise or approximate location data to show you the nearest autopass branches on our interactive map and build navigation routes. You can enable or disable location services at any time through your device settings.",
        "financialTitle": "D. Financial Data",
        "financialBody": "When you purchase a subscription plan, your payment is processed by third-party payment processors. We do not store or process your full credit card numbers or raw banking details on our servers.",
        "deviceTitle": "E. Usage and Device Data",
        "deviceBody": "We automatically collect certain information when you access the App, including your mobile device ID, device model, operating system version, app usage statistics, and interactions (such as the generating of QR codes or booking history).",
        "useTitle": "2. How We Use Your Information",
        "useLead": "We use the information we collect about you for various operational and business purposes, including to:",
        "useAccount": "Create and manage your personal account.",
        "usePlans": "Process your subscription plans and generate QR codes for car wash access.",
        "useBookings": "Manage your bookings and schedule appointments.",
        "useNotify": "Send you administrative notifications, such as booking confirmations, subscription renewals, and security alerts via Push Notifications or SMS.",
        "useLocation": "Identify your location to suggest the nearest car wash facilities.",
        "useImprove": "Improve the App’s functionality, user experience, and overall service quality.",
        "useSupport": "Process feedback, ratings, and customer support requests.",
        "shareTitle": "3. Disclosure of Your Information",
        "shareLead": "We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following situations:",
        "shareProvidersLabel": "Service Providers:",
        "shareProviders": "We may share your data with third-party vendors, IT hosting providers, SMS delivery services, and payment processors who perform services for us or on our behalf.",
        "shareLegalLabel": "Legal Obligations:",
        "shareLegal": "We may disclose your information where we are legally required to do so in order to comply with applicable laws, governmental requests, a judicial proceeding, or court orders.",
        "shareTransferLabel": "Business Transfers:",
        "shareTransfer": "If we undergo a merger, acquisition, or sale of all or a portion of our assets, your personal information may be transferred to the successor entity.",
        "retentionTitle": "4. Data Retention and Deletion",
        "retentionBody": "We will retain your personal information only for as long as is necessary for the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy.",
        "deletionLabel": "Account Deletion:",
        "deletionBody": "You have the right to delete your account and personal data at any time. You can do this directly within the App by navigating to My Data and selecting Delete Account. Upon request, we will delete your personal and vehicle data, except for information we are required to retain by law (such as transaction history for tax purposes).",
        "securityTitle": "5. Security of Your Information",
        "securityBody": "We use administrative, technical, and physical security measures to help protect your personal information. While we have taken reasonable steps to secure the personal information you provide to us, please be aware that despite our efforts, no security measures are perfect or impenetrable, and no method of data transmission can be guaranteed against any interception or other type of misuse.",
        "childrenTitle": "6. Children's Privacy",
        "childrenBody": "The App is not intended for use by children under the age of 13 (or the applicable age of digital consent in your region). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child without parental consent, we will take steps to securely delete that information.",
        "changesTitle": "7. Changes to This Privacy Policy",
        "changesBody": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or relevant laws. We will notify you of any changes by updating the effective date of this policy and, where necessary, via a push notification or an in-app alert.",
        "back": "Read it, come back"
    },
